==== hyperbricks yaml {!{hypermedia}} ====
hypermedia:
  - type: hypermedia
  - head:
      "10":
        - type: javascript
        - attributes:
            type: text/javascript
        - file: hyperbricks-yaml-test-files/assets/main.js
==== explainer ====
File overrides link and inline, it loads contents of a file and renders it in a script tag.
==== expected json ====
{
  "BodyTag": "",
  "Cache": "",
  "ConfigCategory": "",
  "ConfigType": "<HYPERMEDIA>",
  "ContentType": "",
  "Cookies": null,
  "Doctype": "",
